<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#080e18"><title>Operation Lockdown | Facilitator Control</title><link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/img/favicon.svg"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/system.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/polish.css"></head><body>
<header class="site-header"><a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">OL</span><span class="brand-text"><strong>OPERATION LOCKDOWN</strong><small>Staff Control Centre</small></span></a><nav><a href="/">Mission hub</a><a href="/leaderboard/">Leaderboard</a><a href="/facilitator/" aria-current="page">Staff control</a><span class="connection-indicator" data-connection-status="checking" data-status="checking" role="status">Checking server</span></nav></header>
<main class="system"><div class="page-meta"><span class="eyebrow">Restricted access // Facilitator only</span><span class="meta-tag">EVENT MANAGEMENT</span></div><h1 class="hero">Run the <span class="accent">mission.</span></h1><p class="subtitle">Manage the rotation timer, monitor group results, award a key if equipment fails, and investigate testing errors. Actions are recorded by the server.</p>
<section class="system-card" id="authCard" style="max-width:560px"><div class="section-tag">Staff authorisation</div><h2>Facilitator login</h2><p class="card-intro">Use the staff account you created during database setup.</p><form id="authForm"><label for="username">Username</label><input id="username" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="Staff username"><label for="password">Password</label><input id="password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Staff password"><div class="actions"><button class="action grow" id="authSubmit" type="submit">Sign in to control centre →</button></div></form><p id="authMessage" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></section>
<div id="controls" class="hidden"><div class="admin-grid"><section class="system-card"><div class="section-tag">Session management</div><div class="row"><h2>Rotation timer</h2><span class="pill" id="roundLabel">Rotation 1</span></div><div id="currentTimer" class="timer" style="margin:20px 0 24px">--:--</div><div class="admin-actions"><button id="startTimer" class="action" type="button">Start / resume</button><button id="pauseTimer" class="action secondary" type="button">Pause</button><button id="resetTimer" class="action secondary" type="button">Reset current timer</button><button id="nextRound" class="action secondary" type="button">Next rotation →</button></div><div class="divider"></div><div class="fieldgroup"><div><label for="minutes">Minutes per rotation</label><input id="minutes" type="number" min="5" max="60" value="30"></div><button id="setMinutes" class="action secondary" type="button">Save duration</button></div><div class="actions"><button id="resetRounds" class="action small secondary" type="button">Restart all rotations</button></div></section>
<section class="system-card"><div class="section-tag">Manual support</div><h2>Group recovery controls</h2><p class="card-intro">Use these tools only if a group is blocked by a technical fault, or when clearing test data.</p><div class="field-grid"><div><label for="targetGroup">Rotation group</label><select id="targetGroup"><option value="alpha">Alpha</option><option value="bravo">Bravo</option><option value="charlie">Charlie</option></select></div><div><label for="keyZone">Recovery key</label><select id="keyZone"><option value="train">AI Defence Activated</option><option value="fix">Portal Secured</option><option value="defend">Threat Contained</option></select></div></div><label for="overrideReason">Reason for manual award</label><input id="overrideReason" placeholder="e.g. a workstation stopped responding"><div class="actions"><button id="awardKey" class="action secondary" type="button">Award selected key</button></div><div class="divider"></div><button id="resetGroup" class="action danger" type="button">Erase selected group's results</button><p class="note"><strong>Careful:</strong> resetting a group permanently deletes that group's saved tasks, keys and scores.</p></section></div>
<section class="system-card" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="row"><div><div class="section-tag">Verified group results</div><h2>Team overview</h2></div><span class="pill" id="refreshLabel">Updates every 7 sec</span></div><div id="groupInfo">Loading groups…</div></section>
<section class="system-card" style="margin-top:18px"><div class="section-tag">Your recent actions</div><h2>Action feedback</h2><p id="actionMessage" class="message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="actionLog" class="log-list" aria-live="polite"><div class="log-entry">Changes you make in this session will be listed here.</div></div></section></div>
</main><script src="/assets/js/ui.js" defer></script><script type="module" src="/assets/js/facilitator.js"></script></body></html>
